sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as Client + its server
  participant J as Backend
  participant G as Google
  U->>C: Username or email, and password
  C->>J: POST /api/auth/login
  Note over J: Username first, an email only if<br/>exactly one account has it.<br/>BCrypt check, account enabled
  J-->>C: JWT, name and role
  Note over C: Sent later as<br/>Authorization: Bearer
  U->>C: Continue with Google
  C->>G: Google sign-in pop-up
  G-->>C: Signed ID token
  C->>J: POST /api/auth/google
  J->>G: Public keys (cached 6 h)
  Note over J: Check signature, audience,<br/>verified email
  opt New customer
    J-->>C: needsPhone, needsUserName
    U->>C: Chosen username and phone number
    C->>J: Same token + username + phone
  end
  J-->>C: JWT for the account
